pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: WHY NOW
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 60, 700, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 为什么现在学编程不一样了
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 112, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: old-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 136, 380, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$muted"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 过去的编程课
  - elementId: old-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 170, 380, 180]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 先背语法，再写代码，错误提示看不懂</p>
        <p>· 一个拼写错误卡一节课，挫败感强</p>
        <p>· 练习脱离真实场景，学完不知道能做什么</p>
  - elementId: divider-v
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 136, 1, 320]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: new-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 136, 380, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 现在：AI 协同编程时代
  - elementId: new-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 170, 380, 180]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· <span style="color:$cyan">AI 代码补全</span>：写一半，AI 猜你想写的下一半</p>
        <p>· <span style="color:$cyan">Vibe Coding</span>：用自然语言描述想法，AI 生成程序</p>
        <p>· 从第一节课开始就做出能玩、能用的作品</p>
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 380, 832, 78]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 380, 784, 78]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>本课程的核心立场：<span style="color:$accent">语法不再是门槛，想法才是。</span></p>
        <p>学生要练的不是死记硬背，而是"把想法说清楚、让 AI 做出来"的能力。</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 500, 64, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 02 / 15
